2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Process\040and\040Policy\072\040Resource\055Bounded\040NonDemonstrative\040Reasoning)
/Author (Ronald\040P\056\040Loui)
/Subject (This\040paper\040investigates\040the\040appropriateness\040of\040formal\040dialectics\040as\040a\040basis\040for\040nonmonotonic\040reasoning\040and\040defeasible\040reasoning\040that\040takes\040computational\040limits\040seriously\056\040Rules\040that\040can\040come\040into\040conflict\040should\040be\040regarded\040as\040policies\054\040which\040are\040inputs\040to\040deliberative\040processes\056\040Dialectical\040protocols\040are\040appropriate\040for\040such\040deliberations\040when\040resources\040are\040bounded\040and\040search\040is\040serial\056\015\012\015\012\015\012\015\012AI\054\040it\040is\040claimed\040here\054\040is\040now\040perfectly\040positioned\040to\040correct\040many\040misconceptions\040about\040reasoning\040that\040have\040resulted\040from\040mathematical\040logic\047s\040enormous\040success\040in\040this\040century\072\040among\040them\054\040\0501\051\040that\040all\040reasons\040are\040demonstrative\054\040\0502\051\040that\040rational\040belief\040is\040constrained\054\040not\040constructed\054\040and\040\0503\051\040that\040process\040and\040disputation\040are\040not\040essential\040to\040reasoning\056\040AI\040mainly\040provides\040new\040impetus\040to\040formalize\040the\040alternative\040\050but\040older\051\040conception\040of\040reasoning\054\040and\040AI\040provides\040mechanisms\040with\040which\040to\040create\040compelling\040formalism\040that\040describes\040the\040control\040of\040processes\056\015\012\015\012\015\012\015\012The\040technical\040contributions\040here\040are\072\040the\040partial\040justification\040of\040dialectic\040based\040on\040controlling\040search\073\040the\040observation\040that\040nonmonotonic\040reasoning\040can\040be\040subsumed\040under\040certain\040kinds\040of\040dialectics\073\040the\040portrayal\040of\040inference\040in\040knowledge\040bases\040as\040policy\040reasoning\073\040the\040review\040of\040logics\040of\040dialogue\040and\040proposed\040extensions\073\040and\040the\040preformal\040and\040initial\040formal\040discussion\040of\040aspects\040and\040variations\040of\040dialectical\040systems\040with\040nondemonstrative\040reasons\056)
/Keywords (01\040Feb\0401998\054\040Computational\040Intelligence\054\040Deductive\040reasoning\054\040Defeasible\040reasoning\054\040Non\055monotonic\040logic\054\040Reasoning\040system\054\040Analytic\040reasoning\054\040Washington\040University\040in\040St\056\040Louis)
>>
endobj
